INSERT INTO `companies` VALUES (1,'StitchCraft Materials','StitchCraftMaterials@email.com','910101101','Rua das Agulhas, 27, Lisboa, Portugal','505101101','Welcome to StitchCraft Materials, your premier supplier of high-quality textiles and crafting materials for the apparel, fashion, and crafting industries. We offer a wide range of fabrics, trims, buttons, zippers, threads, and other essential materials sourced from reputable manufacturers.\nOur extensive catalog includes cotton, linen, silk, wool, denim, and more, meeting the stringent standards of professional designers, manufacturers, and retailers. We support high-fashion couture, ready-to-wear collections, and accessory production.\nWith a focus on efficiency, consistency, and professionalism, our dedicated account managers ensure your material requirements, production timelines, and budgets are met. We offer competitive pricing, bulk ordering, and streamlined logistics for a seamless supply chain experience.\nPartner with StitchCraft Materials for premium products that enhance your brand and production capabilities. Committed to quality, reliability, and customer satisfaction, we are your trusted partner in the fashion and textiles industry.','LogoStitch.png','$2a$10$gQaaMOBqpR1GP7i6slhwoOUSa9GZL7Y5Ku6r2lzm9GG5ipO8EwqXO','Portugal'),(2,'EcoFiber','EcoFiber@email.com','211102102','Av. da Sustentabilidade, 42, Barcelona, Espanha','505102102','Welcome to EcoFiber, your trusted supplier of sustainable textile fibers with a focus on eco-friendly polyester. We specialize in polyester fibers derived from recycled sources, promoting sustainability and reducing waste in the textile industry.\nOur advanced recycling technologies transform post-consumer plastic waste into high-quality fibers suitable for various applications. By choosing EcoFiber, you contribute to the circular economy and lower your carbon footprint without sacrificing quality or performance.\nCommitted to transparency and collaboration, we work closely with clients to meet their sustainability goals and product needs. Join us in creating a greener future with EcoFiber is eco-friendly polyester fibers. Lets weave a sustainable tomorrow together.','EcoFiber.png','$2a$10$gQaaMOBqpR1GP7i6slhwoOUSa9GZL7Y5Ku6r2lzm9GG5ipO8EwqXO','Spain'),(3,'StyleWeave Fashion','StyleWeaveFashion@email.com','211103103','Rue de la Mode, 15, Paris, França','505103103','Welcome to StyleWeave Fashion, where creativity, elegance, and individuality meet. As a leading name in the fashion industry, we design clothing that inspires confidence and expresses personal style.\nWe view clothing as an art form, creating timeless pieces that go beyond trends. Our collections, from chic casual wear to glamorous evening attire, are crafted with modern cuts, luxurious fabrics, and exquisite detailing.\nOur commitment to quality and craftsmanship sets us apart. We work with skilled artisans and use premium materials to ensure comfort, durability, and style. StyleWeave Fashion values inclusivity, offering a range of sizes and styles for all body types and ages.\nExperience modern fashion with StyleWeave Fashion. Explore our collections, discover your style, and make a statement of elegance and sophistication. With StyleWeave Fashion, every outfit tells a story of creativity and impeccable taste.','StyleWeaveFashion.png','$2a$10$gQaaMOBqpR1GP7i6slhwoOUSa9GZL7Y5Ku6r2lzm9GG5ipO8EwqXO','France'),(4,'Gentle Groom','GentleGroom@email.com','910201201','Schönheitsstraße 12, Berlin, Alemanha','505201201','Welcome to Gentle Groom, your premier destination for top-quality hair and beard care essentials. We provide the best products to help you maintain a well-groomed appearance.\nOur product line includes nourishing hair oils, shampoos, styling waxes, and beard balms, all made with natural ingredients and free from harsh chemicals. We believe in the power of nature to enhance beauty.\nGentle Groom is your partner in personal grooming. We are committed to customer satisfaction, offering products that meet and exceed expectations. Whether taming a beard or styling hair, Gentle Groom has what you need to look and feel your best.\nExperience the Gentle Groom difference—quality and craftsmanship in every bottle. Embrace your style and showcase your best self with our sophisticated grooming products.','GentleGroom.png','$2a$10$gQaaMOBqpR1GP7i6slhwoOUSa9GZL7Y5Ku6r2lzm9GG5ipO8EwqXO','Germany'),(5,'Prime Beauty','PrimeBeauty@email.com','961202202','Via Bellezza, 10, Milão, Itália','505202202','Welcome to Prime Beauty, a leader in innovation and quality in the beauty industry. We supply premium raw materials to help cosmetics companies create exceptional makeup and skincare products.\nAt Prime Beauty, we source the finest ingredients from trusted global partners. Our diverse portfolio includes organic, sustainable, and scientifically advanced materials for both makeup and skincare. We rigorously test all our raw materials for purity, efficacy, and safety to meet the highest industry standards.\nWe work closely with clients to provide tailored solutions that enhance product performance and consumer satisfaction. Prime Beauty supports you with market insights, formulation expertise, and a commitment to sustainability and ethical sourcing.\nWhether you are a startup or an established brand, Prime Beauty is dedicated to helping you achieve your vision with outstanding beauty products. Discover exceptional ingredients with Prime Beauty, where your next breakthrough begins.','PrimeBeauty.png','$2a$10$gQaaMOBqpR1GP7i6slhwoOUSa9GZL7Y5Ku6r2lzm9GG5ipO8EwqXO','Italy'),(6,'PureGlow Cosmetics','PureGlowCosmetics@email.com','211203203','Calle de la Luminosidad, 8, Madrid, Espanha','505203203','Welcome to PureGlow Cosmetics, where beauty meets purity. We offer products designed to enhance your natural beauty and boost your confidence, using only clean, high-performance ingredients.\nAt PureGlow, we craft our makeup with the finest natural components, free from harsh chemicals and additives. Whether you need a flawless foundation, vibrant lipstick, or soothing moisturizer, our products deliver exceptional results while being gentle on your skin.\nOur innovative line caters to diverse beauty needs, with long-lasting formulas and rich pigments for perfect coverage. PureGlow is dedicated to sustainability and ethical practices, offering cruelty-free products and eco-friendly packaging.\nExperience makeup that enhances your beauty without compromising on quality or values. With PureGlow Cosmetics, embrace a radiant, healthier, and more sustainable beauty routine.','PureGlowCosmetics.png','$2a$10$gQaaMOBqpR1GP7i6slhwoOUSa9GZL7Y5Ku6r2lzm9GG5ipO8EwqXO','Spain'),(7,'GentleCut','GentleCut@email.com','211204204','Rua da Tranquilidade, 20, Porto, Portugal','505204204','Welcome to GentleCut, where exceptional grooming experiences await. As a leading barber chain, we specialize in precision haircuts, expert styling, and comprehensive grooming services tailored to each client.\nCombining classic barbering with modern techniques, our skilled barbers ensure you look your best, whether it is a quick trim or a luxurious grooming service. Our shops offer a contemporary yet relaxed atmosphere, using only the finest products for hair and skin.\nAt GentleCut, we value your time and trust, offering efficient service without compromising quality. Each visit is a moment to refresh, relax, and rejuvenate.\nDiscover the GentleCut difference today at any of our locations, where grooming goes beyond the surface. Experience tailored service that leaves you ready to face the world with confidence.','GentleCut.png','$2a$10$gQaaMOBqpR1GP7i6slhwoOUSa9GZL7Y5Ku6r2lzm9GG5ipO8EwqXO','Portugal'),(8,'ElectraForge Technologies','ElectraForgeTechnologies@email.com','910301301','Avenue de lInnovation, 33, Bruxelas, Bélgica','505301301','ElectraForge Technologies specializes in designing, developing, and manufacturing high-quality electronic components for diverse industries. Our focus on cutting-edge technology delivers reliable solutions that empower businesses in their pursuit of innovation.\nOur range includes semiconductors, integrated circuits, sensors, connectors, and more, optimized for performance and compatibility across automotive, telecommunications, consumer electronics, and industrial sectors.\nWe prioritize innovation, quality, and customer satisfaction, with skilled engineers ensuring every component meets rigorous standards. Partner with ElectraForge for unparalleled expertise and support in driving technological progress globally.','ElectraForge.png','$2a$10$gQaaMOBqpR1GP7i6slhwoOUSa9GZL7Y5Ku6r2lzm9GG5ipO8EwqXO','Belgium'),(9,'DataBridge Creations','DataBridgeCreations@email.com','961302302','Rua da Inovação, 25, Lisboa, Portugal','505302302','Welcome to DataBridge Creations, your premier source for custom network cables and connectivity solutions. We specialize in manufacturing and distributing high-quality custom cables tailored to the unique networking requirements of businesses, organizations, and data centers worldwide.\nOur product lineup includes Ethernet, fiber optic, and coaxial cables, available in various lengths, colors, and configurations to suit your needs. Whether you need standard Cat5e cables or advanced fiber optic solutions, DataBridge has you covered.\nWhat sets us apart is our commitment to customization and quality. We offer bespoke cable assembly services, working closely with you to design and manufacture cables precisely tailored to your specifications.\nIn addition to custom cables, we provide comprehensive support and expertise to optimize your network performance. Our knowledgeable professionals offer technical assistance, product recommendations, and guidance throughout the process.\nPartner with DataBridge Creations for unparalleled quality, reliability, and customer service in building robust networking infrastructure for the digital age.','DataBrigeCreations.png','$2a$10$gQaaMOBqpR1GP7i6slhwoOUSa9GZL7Y5Ku6r2lzm9GG5ipO8EwqXO','Portugal'),(10,'PrintCraft Innovations','PrintCraft Innovations@email.com','211303303','Via dell Innovazione, 12, Milão, Itália','505303303','Welcome to PrintCraft Innovations, your gateway to cutting-edge custom 3D printing services. Dedicated to innovation and creativity, we specialize in personalized solutions tailored to bring your ideas to life in three dimensions.\nOur advanced technology and skilled team transform your concepts into tangible realities, whether its prototypes, product models, custom parts, or intricate sculptures. We offer a wide range of printing materials and techniques, ensuring precision and accuracy with state-of-the-art equipment overseen by expert technicians.\nWe value lasting relationships with our clients, working closely to understand your vision and objectives. Whether you need design optimization, material selection, or production planning, our team provides the guidance and support for success.\nPartner with PrintCraft Innovations for your custom 3D printing needs. Let us help you bring your ideas to life with precision, efficiency, and creativity. With our commitment to innovation and customer satisfaction, PrintCraft is your trusted partner in additive manufacturing.','PrintCraftInnovations.png','$2a$10$gQaaMOBqpR1GP7i6slhwoOUSa9GZL7Y5Ku6r2lzm9GG5ipO8EwqXO','Italy'),(11,'Fresco Supply','FrescoSupply@email.com','910401401','Rua do Frescor, 15, Lisboa, Portugal','505401401','Welcome to Fresco Supply, your trusted partner in elevating dining experiences with premium food and beverage offerings. Specializing in high-quality ingredients, we cater exclusively to hotels, restaurants, and culinary establishments.\nWe pride ourselves on sourcing the finest products globally, from organic produce to international delicacies, meeting diverse culinary needs. Our commitment to freshness and quality ensures every item meets the highest standards.\nOur offerings include:\n•	Fresh produce\n•	Artisanal cheeses\n•	Premium meats and seafood\n•	Specialty beverages\n•	Gourmet condiments and spices\nBeyond supplying, we offer support and advice to keep your menu innovative. Partner with Fresco Supply for an unmatched selection that delights guests and elevates dining experiences. Trust us to be the backbone of your culinary excellence.','FrescoSupply.png','$2a$10$gQaaMOBqpR1GP7i6slhwoOUSa9GZL7Y5Ku6r2lzm9GG5ipO8EwqXO','Portugal'),(12,'EliteSpirits Distributors','EliteSpiritsDistributors@email.com','961402402','Avenida dos Destilados, 50, Madrid, Espanha','505402402','Welcome to EliteSpirits Distributors, your premier source for an exquisite selection of wines and spirits. Catering to bars, restaurants, and luxury hotels, we specialize in providing a comprehensive portfolio of alcoholic beverages from around the world. Our mission is to elevate beverage offerings with exceptional products that enhance any dining experience or special occasion.\nWe take pride in sourcing rare and sought-after wines, spirits, and liqueurs, curated to meet discerning tastes. Our offerings include exclusive wines from renowned vineyards, a diverse range of spirits, and specialty liqueurs for cocktail creation.\nWhat sets us apart is personalized service. We offer tailored recommendations and flexible delivery options to align with your business needs. Our knowledgeable staff provide expert advice and support to ensure you receive the best products for your menu and customer preferences.\nPartner with EliteSpirits Distributors for a truly elite selection. Let us help you captivate guests with remarkable flavors and memorable beverage experiences.','EliteSpirits.png','$2a$10$gQaaMOBqpR1GP7i6slhwoOUSa9GZL7Y5Ku6r2lzm9GG5ipO8EwqXO','Spain'),(13,'Maykro','Maykro@email.com','211403403','Rua da Criatividade, 15, Porto, Portugal','505403403','Welcome to Maykro, your essential partner in the food and beverage supply industry. We specialize in distributing a broad range of top-quality ingredients and beverages to restaurants, cafes, and catering services.\nWe are committed to sourcing the finest ingredients and most refreshing beverages to ensure your menu stands out. Our extensive product range includes farm-fresh produce, premium meats, artisanal breads, and specialty coffees.\nWhat sets us apart is our dedication to quality and reliability. We work closely with trusted suppliers to ensure all our products meet stringent standards. Our efficient logistics system guarantees timely delivery to support your continuous operation.\nOur offerings include fresh and frozen produce, high-quality meats and seafood, fine wines, craft beers, and comprehensive coffee and tea solutions.\nWith Maykro, you gain a reliable partner who understands the nuances of the foodservice industry. Our passionate team provides not just supplies, but also support and advice to enhance your offerings.\nPartner with Maykro for exceptional service and products that elevate your food and beverage experiences. Let us help you delight your customers and grow your business with the best supplies available.','Maykro.png','$2a$10$gQaaMOBqpR1GP7i6slhwoOUSa9GZL7Y5Ku6r2lzm9GG5ipO8EwqXO','Portugal'),(14,'InteriorVibes Co.','InteriorVibes@email.com','910501501','Avenida da Harmonia, 30, Lisboa, Portugal','505501501','Welcome to InteriorVibes Co., your destination for bespoke interior decoration services that bring spaces to life with style, comfort, and functionality. Our passionate team of designers and decorators is dedicated to creating inspiring interiors that reflect your personality and enhance your lifestyle.\nWe offer comprehensive interior decoration services covering space planning, color schemes, furniture selection, lighting design, and more. With a personalized approach, we work closely with you to understand your needs, preferences, and budget.\nFrom concept development to final execution, we handle every detail with precision. Using high-quality materials and furnishings, we ensure a cohesive result that aligns with your aesthetic aspirations.\nWhether you prefer contemporary, classic, minimalist, or eclectic styles, we have the expertise to bring your design dreams to life. Our goal is to create spaces that not only look beautiful but also function seamlessly to enhance your well-being.\nExperience transformative interior design with InteriorVibes Co. Let us infuse your spaces with positive vibes and timeless elegance, making every room a reflection of your lifestyle. Partner with us to unlock the full potential of your interiors and create spaces that resonate with joy and inspiration.','InteriorVibes.png','$2a$10$gQaaMOBqpR1GP7i6slhwoOUSa9GZL7Y5Ku6r2lzm9GG5ipO8EwqXO','Portugal'),(15,'InterSpace','InterSpace@email.com','961502502','Rue de lEspace, 15, Paris, França','505502502','Welcome to InterSpace, your specialized partner in creating distinctive and inviting spaces for restaurants and cafés. We blend aesthetics with functionality to design environments that enhance dining experiences and elevate customer satisfaction.\nOur services cater specifically to the hospitality sector, focusing on the unique needs of restaurants and cafés. Whether launching a new café or refurbishing an existing restaurant, our expert team of designers, architects, and project managers is committed to transforming your vision into reality.\nWe understand that ambiance is crucial, so we offer customized design solutions reflecting your brand’s identity and appealing to your target audience. Our designs maximize space use and operational efficiency.\nOur services include concept development, interior design, furniture selection, lighting solutions, and project management. We prioritize innovation and sustainability, using eco-friendly materials and smart technologies.\nPartner with InterSpace to create a dining destination. Let us help you captivate guests and turn first-time visitors into regulars.','InterSpace.png','$2a$10$gQaaMOBqpR1GP7i6slhwoOUSa9GZL7Y5Ku6r2lzm9GG5ipO8EwqXO','France'),(16,'CorporateStyle Furnishings','CorporateStyleFurnishings@email.com','211503503','Via dell Eleganza, 10, Milão, Itália','505503503','Welcome to CorporateStyle Furnishings, where we specialize in high-quality, stylish, and functional furniture solutions for modern office environments. Our range is designed to enhance productivity and comfort, tailored to suit diverse workplace needs.\nWe offer:\n•	Workstations: Ergonomic designs for enhanced productivity and comfort during long hours.\n•	Reception Furniture: Stylish desks and seating options for a positive first impression.\n•	Meeting Room Furnishings: Functional tables and chairs for collaboration.\nCommitted to quality and durability, we use the best materials and prioritize sustainability in our manufacturing processes.\nWhether setting up a new office or upgrading an existing space, our customized solutions meet specific needs and aesthetic preferences. Our expert team offers design consultation and space planning services to maximize your office environment.\nChoose CorporateStyle Furnishings for office furniture that combines style, functionality, and durability, creating a better workplace.','CorporateStyle.png','$2a$10$gQaaMOBqpR1GP7i6slhwoOUSa9GZL7Y5Ku6r2lzm9GG5ipO8EwqXO','Italy'),(17,'AgroTech','AgroTech@email.com','910601601','Rua da Agricultura, 10, Lisboa, Portugal','505601601','Welcome to AgroTech, a leader in providing cutting-edge technological solutions tailored for the agricultural sector. We are committed to enhancing the efficiency, productivity, and sustainability of farms worldwide.\nOur offerings include:\n- Precision Agriculture Technologies: Utilize GPS, drones, and IoT sensors for optimized field-level management.\n- Farm Management Software: Streamlined solutions for tracking farm activities and making data-driven decisions.\n- Sustainable Farming Consultations: Expert advice on implementing sustainable practices.\nAgroTech is dedicated to innovation and sustainability. Our team works closely with each client to tailor solutions to their specific challenges and goals.\nEmbrace the future of farming with AgroTech. Partner with us to elevate your agricultural operations.','Agrotech.png','$2a$10$gQaaMOBqpR1GP7i6slhwoOUSa9GZL7Y5Ku6r2lzm9GG5ipO8EwqXO','Portugal'),(18,'Green Harvest','GreenHarvest@email.com','961602602','Avenida da Sustentabilidade, 50, Porto, Portugal','505602602','Welcome to Green Harvest, a pioneering food production company dedicated to cultivating fresh, high-quality produce. By partnering with AgriSeeds for top agricultural seeds, we ensure that every product meets the highest standards of quality and sustainability.\nWe leverage advanced agricultural practices and innovative technologies to maximize yield and enhance nutritional value. Our farms, strategically located in optimal growing regions, produce a diverse range of fruits and vegetables year-round.\nKey aspects of our operation include:\n- Integrated Farm Management: Precision farming techniques optimize water usage, nutrient application, and pest management.\n- Quality Control: From seed selection to harvesting, our processes maintain the highest quality and freshness.\n- Local and Organic Options: We offer organic produce grown without synthetic pesticides or fertilizers.\nGreen Harvest is committed to food safety and environmental stewardship. We work closely with communities and adhere to strict regulations to minimize our ecological footprint and support sustainable agricultural development.\nChoose Green Harvest for fresh, quality produce directly from farm to table.','GreenHarvest.png','$2a$10$gQaaMOBqpR1GP7i6slhwoOUSa9GZL7Y5Ku6r2lzm9GG5ipO8EwqXO','Portugal'),(19,'AgroFeed','AgroFeed@email.com','910701701','Avenida das Colheitas, 15, Santarém, Portugal','505701701','Welcome to AgroFeed, your dedicated supplier of high-quality animal feed for farm livestock. Specializing in nutritionally balanced feed, we ensure your animals receive the best care for health, growth, and productivity.\nWe provide a comprehensive range of feed products tailored to meet the specific needs of different animals, including cattle, poultry, pigs, and sheep. Our feeds are formulated using the latest scientific research to optimize health and output.\nKey features:\n- Custom Feed Solutions: Tailored formulations ensure the right balance of nutrients.\n- Quality Ingredients: Made from high-quality, safe, and sustainable ingredients.\n- Expert Advice: Our team of animal nutrition experts provides guidance and support.\nAgroFeed is committed to innovation and excellence in animal nutrition, helping farmers improve efficiency and animal health. Partner with us for thriving livestock and sustainable farming operations.','AgroFeed.png','$2a$10$gQaaMOBqpR1GP7i6slhwoOUSa9GZL7Y5Ku6r2lzm9GG5ipO8EwqXO','Portugal'),(20,'Paw Perfect','PawPerfect@email.com','961702702','Calle de los Perros, 20, Madrid, Espanha','505702702','Welcome to Paw Perfect, your premier grooming service provider dedicated to supporting veterinarians and pet stores with expert grooming solutions. Our comprehensive grooming services cater to the specific needs of pets, enhancing their well-being and appearance.\nOur professional groomers are skilled in handling all types of pets, providing bathing, haircuts, nail trimming, and ear cleaning for dogs, cats, and more exotic animals.\nKey features:\n- Mobile Grooming Units: Convenient grooming service at your veterinary clinic or pet store.\n- Customized Grooming Packages: Tailored to meet the diverse needs of pets based on breed, size, and coat type.\n- Quality Care: We use the best grooming products and techniques for a safe and stress-free experience.\nPaw Perfect is committed to excellence in pet care, enhancing your service offerings with top-tier grooming services. Partner with us to provide exceptional grooming that keeps pets looking and feeling their best.','PawPerfect.png','$2a$10$gQaaMOBqpR1GP7i6slhwoOUSa9GZL7Y5Ku6r2lzm9GG5ipO8EwqXO','Spain'),(21,'PetHealth Supply','PetHealthSupply@email.com','961703703','Rua dos Cuidados Animais, 12, Lisboa, Portugal','505703703','Welcome to PetHealth Supply, your comprehensive source for veterinary products, from medications to specialized equipment. We are dedicated to providing veterinarians with the tools for top-notch pet care.\nWe offer a curated range of items meeting strict safety and effectiveness standards, supporting vets in various aspects of animal healthcare.\nKey offerings:\n- Medications: Treatments including antibiotics, anti-inflammatories, and chronic disease management drugs.\n- Hygiene Products: Premium grooming tools, dental care items, and dermatological solutions for pet hygiene.\n- Equipment and Instruments: Diagnostic and surgical tools, from hand tools to advanced imaging systems.\nPetHealth Supply prioritizes reliability, quality, and customer service, assisting vets in practice efficiency and success in pet care. Partner with us for top resources in animal healthcare.','PetHealth.png','$2a$10$gQaaMOBqpR1GP7i6slhwoOUSa9GZL7Y5Ku6r2lzm9GG5ipO8EwqXO','Portugal'),(22,'SportsGear','SportsGear@email.com','910801801','Avenida do Atleta, 18, Porto, Portugal','505801801','Welcome to SportsGear, your go-to for top-quality training equipment for sports clubs and federations. We are dedicated to boosting athletic performance and training efficiency with cutting-edge gear spanning various sports disciplines.\nOur diverse portfolio caters to dynamic athlete and trainer needs, offering everything from gym essentials to advanced training devices.\nKey features:\n- Customized Solutions: Tailored equipment for specific sports requirements, enhancing training relevant to each sport.\n- Durability and Innovation: High-quality materials and latest technological advances ensure durability and functionality.\n- Expert Support: Consultation and support services help clubs and federations optimize their training facilities.\nEquip your athletes with the best from SportsGear, your trusted partner in achieving excellence in sports training and preparation.','SportsGear.png','$2a$10$gQaaMOBqpR1GP7i6slhwoOUSa9GZL7Y5Ku6r2lzm9GG5ipO8EwqXO','Portugal'),(23,'FitHub Solutions','FitHubSolutions@email.com','961802802','Rua da Saúde, 22, Lisboa, Portugal','505802802','Welcome to FitHub Solutions, your go-to for software services elevating fitness businesses efficiency and marketing prowess. We specialize in management software, online training platforms, and marketing consultancy, dedicated to maximizing gyms, personal trainers, and fitness centers potential.\nOur advanced management software streamlines daily operations, handling everything from membership management to scheduling, freeing up time for delivering exceptional training experiences.\nKey features:\n- Customizable Online Training Platforms: Virtual classes and training sessions expand reach and cater to digital preferences.\n- Marketing Consultancy: Tailored strategies enhance brand visibility, engage clients, and boost retention rates.\n- Data-Driven Insights: Analytics tools provide actionable insights into business performance, facilitating informed decision-making for growth and profitability.\nFitHub Solutions transforms fitness business operations. With our innovative solutions and expert guidance, optimize services, engage clients effectively, and achieve remarkable success in the fitness industry.','FitHub.png','$2a$10$gQaaMOBqpR1GP7i6slhwoOUSa9GZL7Y5Ku6r2lzm9GG5ipO8EwqXO','Portugal'),(24,'GymEquip Pro','GymEquipPro@email.com','961803803','Avenida dos Exercícios, 45, Porto, Portugal','505803803','Welcome to GymEquip Pro, your top supplier of premium gym equipment for fitness centers. From robust machines to precision-engineered free weights, our range ensures your gym meets clientele demands.\nKey features:\n- Comprehensive Range: We offer cardiovascular machines, strength training equipment, and functional fitness gear for holistic physical training.\n- Durability and Design: Our focus on durability and ergonomic design ensures user safety and equipment longevity, minimizing replacements.\n- Custom Solutions: We provide customization options for bulk orders and specific setups, tailoring equipment to your gyms unique needs.\nGymEquip Pro is dedicated to exceptional value and service, enhancing your gyms appeal and functionality. Equip your facility with GymEquip Pro for a state-of-the-art fitness experience.','GymEquip.png','$2a$10$gQaaMOBqpR1GP7i6slhwoOUSa9GZL7Y5Ku6r2lzm9GG5ipO8EwqXO','Portugal'),(25,'FitZone Center','FitZoneCenter@email.com','961804804','Rua da Energia, 30, Lisboa, Portugal','505804804','Welcome to FitZone Center, renowned for exceptional workout environments and top-tier equipment across the region. With a focus on health, wellness, and community, our gyms partner with leading suppliers like SportsGear and GymEquip Pro for superior training machinery.\nKey features:\n- Complete Equipment Range: From cardio machines to strength training gear, our gyms offer everything for a full-body workout.\n- Personalized Fitness Programs: Certified trainers provide tailored workout programs and group classes to meet individual needs and goals.\n- Community Engagement: FitZone Center fosters a supportive community with wellness events, seminars, and fitness challenges to keep members motivated.\nJoin FitZone Center for a thriving fitness community dedicated to health and well-being, providing the tools and environment for achieving your fitness goals.','FitZone.png','$2a$10$gQaaMOBqpR1GP7i6slhwoOUSa9GZL7Y5Ku6r2lzm9GG5ipO8EwqXO','Portugal'),(26,'StyroCrafters Co.','StyroCrafters@email.com','910901901','Boulevard des Artisans, 18, Paris, França','505901901','Welcome to StyroCrafters Co., specializing in crafting custom styrofoam layouts to protect valuable items during shipping. Our goal is to provide innovative solutions for safeguarding fragile goods, ensuring they arrive intact.\nWe understand the importance of protecting investments, offering tailored styrofoam packaging for electronics, artwork, industrial components, and more. Our process begins with assessing shipping needs and item dimensions, followed by crafting custom inserts using cutting-edge technology.\nOur styrofoam layouts are lightweight yet durable, reducing shipping costs while providing superior protection. Customizable designs streamline assembly and disassembly, saving time and resources.\nPartner with StyroCrafters Co. for all your shipping protection needs. With our commitment to quality and reliability, we ensure your valuable items arrive safely, wherever they are destined.','StyroCrafters.png','$2a$10$gQaaMOBqpR1GP7i6slhwoOUSa9GZL7Y5Ku6r2lzm9GG5ipO8EwqXO','France'),(27,'ExpressTransport Co.','ExpressTransport@email.com','961902902','Strada dei Trasporti, 22, Milão, Itália','505902902','Welcome to ExpressTransport Co., a leader in large-scale transportation services tailored to meet businesses logistics needs across sectors. We specialize in providing reliable, efficient, and secure transport solutions for goods on national and international scales.\nOur fleet is equipped to handle bulk shipments, oversized equipment, and sensitive cargo, ensuring every delivery meets safety and regulatory standards. Key features of our services include a diverse fleet, advanced tracking technology, and customized logistics planning.\nPartner with ExpressTransport Co. for your large-scale transportation needs and experience excellence in reliability, efficiency, and customer satisfaction. Whether moving goods nationally or internationally, we deliver with excellence in every shipment.','ExpressTransport.png','$2a$10$gQaaMOBqpR1GP7i6slhwoOUSa9GZL7Y5Ku6r2lzm9GG5ipO8EwqXO','Italy'),(28,'ShipTech Logistics','ShipTechLogistics@email.com','961903903','Avenue de la Logistique, 55, Bruxelas, Bélgica','505903903','Welcome to ShipTech Logistics, your trusted partner in medium-scale transportation services designed to meet the needs of growing businesses and mid-sized enterprises. We specialize in efficient and secure goods transport, offering tailored solutions ensuring your products reach their destinations safely and on time.\nOur flexible services adapt to your specific volume, frequency, and shipment requirements. With a modern fleet and cutting-edge logistics technology, we provide real-time tracking and management, enhancing transparency and reliability. Our experienced team offers personalized service, ensuring every aspect of your transportation needs is met with precision.\nChoose ShipTech Logistics for dependable, efficient, and adaptable transportation services. Partner with us to streamline your logistics operations and focus on growing your business, knowing your shipments are in expert hands.','ShipTech.png','$2a$10$gQaaMOBqpR1GP7i6slhwoOUSa9GZL7Y5Ku6r2lzm9GG5ipO8EwqXO','Belgium'),(29,'CustomPack Solutions','CustomPackSolutions@email.com','961904904','Rua das Embalagens, 40, Lisboa, Portugal','505904904','Introducing CustomPack Solutions, a leader in customized packaging solutions. We specialize in innovative packaging designs that protect your products and elevate your brands presence. Serving diverse industries like retail, food and beverage, and electronics, we provide tailored packaging to meet every clients unique needs.\nOur commitment to quality and innovation drives us to utilize the latest materials and technology. Whether you require eco-friendly options, luxury finishes, or industrial packaging, we deliver exceptional results.\nKey Features:\n- Tailored Design Services: Our experienced designers collaborate closely with you to create packaging that embodies your brands identity and values.\n- Advanced Material Options: Choose from a wide range of materials, including recyclable and biodegradable options, ensuring your packaging is environmentally responsible.\n- State-of-the-Art Production Technology: Our cutting-edge facilities guarantee precision, efficiency, and quality in every batch of packaging.\nChoose CustomPack Solutions for craftsmanship, customer service, and innovation. Let us bring your packaging ideas to life, enhancing your products appeal and ensuring it stands out on the shelves.','CustomPack.png','$2a$10$gQaaMOBqpR1GP7i6slhwoOUSa9GZL7Y5Ku6r2lzm9GG5ipO8EwqXO','Portugal'),(30,'PackPro Supply Co.','PackProSupply@email.com','961905905','Via delle Confezioni, 15\nRoma, Itália','505905905','Welcome to PackPro Supply Co., your go-to source for packaging essentials. We specialize in providing businesses with top-quality paper boxes, envelopes, bags, and tapes. Whether you are a startup or a large corporation, we have the supplies to meet your needs.\nOur mission is to offer versatile and cost-effective packaging options that protect your products and elevate your brand. From eco-friendly choices to custom designs, our inventory supports your operations with excellence and innovation.\nKey Features:\n- Diverse Product Range: We offer a variety of packaging materials, including corrugated boxes, padded envelopes, poly bags, and specialty tapes, available in multiple sizes and specifications.\n- Customization: Add your logo and branding with our printing services, enhancing brand visibility and recognition.\n- Sustainability: We provide environmentally friendly packaging options to help reduce your carbon footprint while ensuring shipment safety.\nPartner with PackPro Supply Co. for seamless service, exceptional quality, and comprehensive support to streamline your operations and enhance your brand impact.','PackPro.png','$2a$10$gQaaMOBqpR1GP7i6slhwoOUSa9GZL7Y5Ku6r2lzm9GG5ipO8EwqXO','Italy'),(36,'Teste Novo','teste_novo@email.com','910100250','Rua do Novo Teste Nº123','123123123','Esta empresa é um teste.','1719757564363.jpg','$2a$10$gQaaMOBqpR1GP7i6slhwoOUSa9GZL7Y5Ku6r2lzm9GG5ipO8EwqXO','Portugal'),(38,'Home Tech','home_tech@email.com','913899899','Rua da Tecnologia','255689689','Empresa de apresentação.','1721224236555.png','$2a$10$gQaaMOBqpR1GP7i6slhwoOUSa9GZL7Y5Ku6r2lzm9GG5ipO8EwqXO','Portugal');
