INSERT INTO `products` VALUES (1,'Silk Fabric','Transforme seus projetos em obras de arte com nossa seda premium. Cada metro deste tecido exala luxo e sofisticação, oferecendo uma sensação de suavidade inigualável. Com uma ampla gama de cores disponíveis, nossa seda é perfeita para uma variedade de projetos, desde roupas elegantes até decoração requintada para o lar. Experimente a beleza intemporal da seda',26.00,1000,50,1,1,'Silk1.jpg','Silk2.jpg','Silk3.jpg',NULL,'€ / m',0,NULL,NULL,'TE-100001'),(2,'Organic Cotton','Explore nossa ampla seleção de produtos feitos com algodão orgânico puro e sustentável. De roupas confortáveis a produtos de cama luxuosos, conectamos você a fornecedores confiáveis em todo o mundo. Nossos parceiros são comprometidos com a qualidade e transparência em cada etapa da produção. Confie em nós para oferecer produtos de algodão orgânico da mais alta qualidade, atendendo às crescentes demandas por sustentabilidade em seu mercado.',15.00,1000,50,1,1,'Cotton1.jpg','Cotton2.jpg','Cotton3.jpg',NULL,'€ / m',0,NULL,NULL,'TE-100002'),(3,'Linen Fabric','O tecido de linho é sinônimo de elegância e sofisticação. Conhecido por sua textura natural e durabilidade, o linho é uma escolha popular para uma variedade de projetos. Desde roupas leves e arejadas até peças de decoração para casa, o linho oferece uma sensação de luxo e conforto incomparável. Explore nossa coleção de tecidos de linho de alta qualidade e descubra uma infinidade de possibilidades para expressar sua criatividade. Deixe-se envolver pela beleza atemporal do linho e adicione um toque de classe aos seus projetos.',12.50,1000,50,1,1,'Linen1.jpg','Linen2.jpg','Linen3.jpg',NULL,'€ / m',0,NULL,NULL,'TE-100003'),(4,'Recycled Polyester Fibers','Our recycled polyester fibers represent a commitment to the future of the planet. Produced from recycled materials, these fibers offer an eco-friendly solution for a wide range of textile applications. From high-performance sportswear to fashion accessories and home products, recycled polyester fibers deliver quality without compromising the environment. Choose sustainability without sacrificing style with our recycled polyester fibers - a conscious choice for a greener future.',4.50,1000,20,2,2,'Fibers1.jpg','Fibers2.jpg','Fibers.jpg',NULL,'€ / m',0,NULL,NULL,'SU-200001'),(5,'Polyester T-Shirt ','We present our high-quality polyester T-Shirts, perfect for companies seeking style and practicality. Crafted with breathable and durable fabric, these shirts offer lasting comfort, ideal for everyday wear. Additionally, our line allows for complete customization, with the possibility of adding logos, designs, and exclusive company information. Choose our polyester T-Shirts to showcase your brand with style and professionalism.',5.50,1000,15,2,2,'PolyesterManT-Shirt1.png','PolyesterManT-Shirt2.png','Tshirt3.png',NULL,'€',0,NULL,NULL,'SU-200002'),(6,'Polyester Travel Backpack ','Introducing our Polyester Travel Backpack, designed to meet the needs of modern businesses on the go. Crafted from durable and lightweight materials, this backpack offers comfort and convenience during your travels. With spacious compartments and organizer pockets, it is perfect for storing laptops, documents, and other essentials. Additionally, we offer customization options so you can add your company logo, ensuring a professional image on every occasion. Choose our Polyester Travel Backpack and travel with style and functionality.',70.00,1000,15,2,2,'PolyesterBackpackfront.png','BackPack2.png','BackPack.png',NULL,'€',0,NULL,NULL,'SU-200003'),(7,'Beard Oil 125ml','Introducing our Beard Oil in a generous 125ml bottle, crafted to nourish and enhance your beards health and appearance. Formulated with a blend of natural oils, including argan and jojoba, this lightweight oil deeply moisturizes the hair and skin, promoting softness and manageability. Whether you are aiming for a sleek, groomed look or a rugged, natural style, our Beard Oil delivers versatile conditioning for all beard types. Treat yourself to the luxurious experience of our Beard Oil and discover a new level of beard care.',19.99,2500,15,4,6,'BeardOil1.jpg','Rituals.jpg','Rituals2.jpg',NULL,'€',0,NULL,NULL,'ME-300001'),(8,'Hair Pomade','Achieve your desired hairstyle effortlessly with our Hair Pomade. Crafted for versatility and long-lasting hold, our pomade provides the perfect balance of flexibility and control. Formulated with high-quality ingredients, it nourishes and moisturizes your hair, leaving it looking healthy and vibrant. Whether you are aiming for a sleek and polished look or a more textured and tousled style, our pomade delivers the perfect finish every time. Elevate your grooming routine with our Hair Pomade and embrace a hairstyle that exudes confidence and style.',30.00,2500,15,4,6,'HairPomade3.jpg','Hair.jpg','Hair1.jpg',NULL,'€',1,24.99,7,'ME-300002'),(9,'Shaving Cream','Transform your shaving routine into a luxurious experience with our Shaving Cream. Formulated with moisturizing and soothing ingredients, our cream creates a rich lather that softens facial hair and cushions the skin for a close and comfortable shave. Its gentle formula helps to prevent irritation and razor burn, leaving your skin feeling refreshed and revitalized after each use. Whether you prefer a traditional wet shave or use it with a brush, our Shaving Cream provides exceptional performance and a refreshing fragrance to invigorate your senses. Elevate your grooming routine with our Shaving Cream and enjoy a smooth and effortless shave every time.',17.00,2500,15,4,6,'ShavingCream1.jpg','Shave2.jpg','Shave.jpg',NULL,'€',0,NULL,NULL,'ME-300003'),(10,'LM741 Amplifier','Introducing the LM741 Amplifier, a versatile and reliable solution for amplifying audio signals with precision and clarity. Designed for high-performance audio applications, this amplifier delivers exceptional sound quality and reliability. With its low distortion and high signal-to-noise ratio, the LM741 ensures accurate reproduction of audio signals across the frequency spectrum. Whether you are building a home audio system, a musical instrument amplifier, or a professional audio setup, the LM741 Amplifier provides the power and fidelity you need to take your sound to the next level. Trust in the LM741 Amplifier for unparalleled audio performance and reliability.',3.99,500,20,8,7,'LM741.jpg','LM741-1.png','LM741-2.png',NULL,'€',0,NULL,NULL,'EL-400001'),(11,'Electrolytic Capacitor, 4.7µF','Introducing our Electrolytic Capacitor, 4.7µF, designed to improve circuit stability and performance. With its compact size and high capacitance, this capacitor is ideal for a wide range of electronic applications. Whether you are building audio amplifiers, power supplies, or digital circuits, our Electrolytic Capacitor provides reliable filtering and smoothing of voltage fluctuations. Its low Equivalent Series Resistance (ESR) ensures efficient energy storage and delivery, while its high capacitance allows for effective noise reduction and voltage regulation. Upgrade your electronic projects with our Electrolytic Capacitor, 4.7µF, and experience improved circuit performance and reliability.',0.35,2500,100,8,7,'ElectrolyticCapacitor47µF.png','Capacitor.png','Capacitor2.png',NULL,'€',0,NULL,NULL,'EL-400002'),(12,'Ethernet Cable Cat6','Introducing our Cat6 Ethernet Cable, designed to provide fast and dependable network connectivity for your home or office. With its Category 6 performance, this cable delivers speeds of up to 1 Gigabit per second, ensuring smooth and seamless data transfer for all your online activities. Whether you are streaming HD videos, gaming online, or transferring large files, our Ethernet Cable Cat6 offers superior performance and stability. Its durable construction and snagless design make it easy to install and use in any environment. Upgrade your network infrastructure with our Ethernet Cable Cat6 and enjoy reliable, high-speed networking for all your devices.',5.00,1000,30,9,8,'EthernetCable1.png','Ethernet2.jpg','Ethernet.jpg',NULL,'€ / m',0,NULL,NULL,'CA-500001'),(13,'Fiber Optic Cable','Introducing our Fiber Optic Cable, the ultimate solution for high-speed and reliable data transmission. Designed to deliver unparalleled performance, our fiber optic cable offers lightning-fast data transfer rates, making it ideal for demanding applications such as internet connectivity, telecommunications, and networking. With its advanced optical technology, this cable ensures minimal signal loss and interference, resulting in superior signal quality over long distances. Its durable construction and flexible design make installation easy and hassle-free. Upgrade your network infrastructure with our Fiber Optic Cable and experience unmatched speed, reliability, and performance.',12.00,1000,30,9,8,'FiberOpticCable1.jpg','Optic2.jpg','Optic.jpg',NULL,'€ / m',0,NULL,NULL,'CA-500002'),(14,'Coaxial Cable','Introducing our Coaxial Cable, designed for reliable signal transmission in various applications. With its durable construction and high-quality materials, our coaxial cable ensures minimal signal loss and interference, making it ideal for use in television, internet, and telecommunications systems. Whether you are connecting antennas, cable modems, or satellite receivers, our coaxial cable delivers clear and consistent signal quality, allowing you to enjoy uninterrupted connectivity. Its versatile design and easy installation make it suitable for both residential and commercial use. Upgrade your communication infrastructure with our Coaxial Cable and experience dependable signal transmission wherever you need it.',3.50,1000,30,9,8,'CoaxialCable1.jpg','Coaxial2.jpg','Coaxial.jpg',NULL,'€ / m',0,NULL,NULL,'CA-500003'),(15,'Organic Tomatoes','Indulge in the rich, vibrant taste of our Organic Heirloom Tomatoes, cultivated with care and commitment to organic farming practices. Bursting with flavor and nutrients, these tomatoes are a true culinary delight, perfect for adding a burst of freshness to salads, sandwiches, and sauces. Grown from heirloom seeds passed down through generations, each tomato is a testament to the time-honored tradition of sustainable agriculture. Free from synthetic pesticides and chemicals, our tomatoes offer pure, wholesome goodness straight from the vine to your table. Elevate your culinary creations with the unmatched taste and quality of our Organic Heirloom Tomatoes and experience the difference that natures bounty can make.',4.00,0,15,11,10,'OrganicHeirloomTomatoes1.jpg','Tomatoes2.jpg','Tomatoes.jpg',NULL,'€ / kg',0,NULL,NULL,'FR-600001'),(16,'Dry-Aged Ribeye Steak','Experience culinary perfection with our Dry-Aged Ribeye Steak, hand-selected for its exceptional marbling and rich flavor profile. Dry-aged to perfection, this premium cut of beef undergoes a meticulous aging process, allowing its natural flavors to intensify and develop complexity. Each bite of our ribeye steak is a symphony of savory goodness, with tender texture and unparalleled juiciness that will tantalize your taste buds. Whether you prefer it grilled, seared, or roasted, our Dry-Aged Ribeye Steak promises to elevate your dining experience to new heights. Treat yourself to the ultimate indulgence and savor the incomparable taste of our Dry-Aged Ribeye Steak today.',25.00,250,20,11,12,'DryAgedRibeyeSteak3.jpg','Steak2.jpg','Steak1.jpg',NULL,'€ / kg',0,NULL,NULL,'ME-700001'),(17,'Blue Cheese','Delight your palate with the distinctive taste of our Blue Cheese, a classic cheese beloved for its bold flavor and creamy texture. Crafted with care and aged to perfection, our Blue Cheese boasts a unique combination of tangy and savory notes, accented by the characteristic blue veins that run through its rich, crumbly interior. Perfect for adding depth to salads, sandwiches, and cheese boards, our Blue Cheese is a versatile and flavorful addition to any dish. Whether enjoyed on its own or paired with your favorite wine or fruit, our Blue Cheese promises to elevate your culinary creations to new heights. Treat yourself to the indulgent taste of our Blue Cheese and experience the allure of this timeless cheese.',20.00,1000,10,11,11,'ArtisanalBlueCheese1.jpg','Cheese.jpg','Cheese2.jpg',NULL,'€ / kg',0,NULL,NULL,'CH-800001'),(18,'Domaine du Castel Grand Vin 2020','Experience the epitome of fine wine with our Domaine du Castel Grand Vin 2020, a testament to the artistry and craftsmanship of winemaking. Produced in the renowned vineyards of Domaine du Castel, this exceptional wine captivates the senses with its harmonious blend of flavors and impeccable balance. Crafted from carefully selected grapes and aged to perfection, our Grand Vin 2020 boasts a complexity and depth that is unmatched. With its lush aromas, velvety texture, and long, satisfying finish, each sip is a journey of indulgence and refinement. Whether enjoyed on its own or paired with gourmet cuisine, Domaine du Castel Grand Vin 2020 promises to elevate every occasion to a moment of pure elegance and sophistication.',80.00,70,12,12,13,'DomaineduCastelGrandVin2020.png','Domaine.jpg','Domaine2.jpg',NULL,'€',0,NULL,NULL,'BE-900001'),(19,'Suntory Yamazaki 12 Anniversary Edition','Embark on a journey of unparalleled craftsmanship and heritage with our Suntory Yamazaki 12 Year 100th Anniversary Edition, a tribute to a century of mastery in Japanese whisky making. Crafted by Suntorys renowned master distillers, this limited edition release celebrates a milestone in the art of whisky production. Aged to perfection for 12 years in oak casks, our Yamazaki 12 Year offers a harmonious balance of delicate flavors, including hints of fruit, spice, and oak, culminating in a smooth and elegant finish. With its distinctive character and exceptional quality, each sip of our Yamazaki 12 Year 100th Anniversary Edition is a celebration of tradition, innovation, and the enduring legacy of Suntory whisky.',230.00,35,3,12,13,'SuntoryYamazaki12Jahre100AnniversaryEdition1.jpg','Suntory.jpg','Suntory2.jpg',NULL,'€',0,NULL,NULL,'BE-900002'),(20,'Basmati Rice 5kg','Discover the exquisite taste and aroma of our Premium Basmati Rice, the perfect foundation for your culinary masterpieces. Renowned for its long, slender grains and delicate fragrance, Basmati Rice is a staple in kitchens around the world. Each grain cooks to fluffy perfection, offering a light and airy texture that complements a wide range of dishes, from aromatic biryanis and pilafs to simple steamed rice. Sourced from the finest rice fields and aged to enhance its unique flavor, our Basmati Rice brings an authentic touch to every meal. Elevate your cooking with the exceptional quality and versatility of our Premium Basmati Rice.',4.00,1000,30,13,11,'BasmatiRice1.jpg','Rice.jpg','Rice2.jpg',NULL,'€',0,NULL,NULL,'CH-800002'),(21,'Chicken Breasts','Experience the quality and taste of our Premium Chicken Breasts, a versatile and lean protein perfect for all your culinary creations. Sourced from trusted farms and carefully selected for their freshness and tenderness, our chicken breasts are a healthy and delicious choice for any meal. Whether grilled, baked, sautéed, or stir-fried, these chicken breasts cook to juicy perfection, making them ideal for a variety of dishes from hearty salads and sandwiches to flavorful main courses. Enjoy the wholesome goodness and superior quality of our Premium Chicken Breasts, and bring nutritious, mouthwatering meals to your table every time.',2.50,100,10,13,12,'ChickenBreasts1.jpg','Chicken.jpg','Chicken2.jpg',NULL,'€ / kg',0,NULL,NULL,'ME-700002'),(22,'Bear','Discover the joy of cuddling with this soft and cuddly bear, designed to be the perfect companion for children and adults alike. Made from plush, high-quality materials, this adorable bear is incredibly soft to the touch, providing comfort and warmth. Its sweet, friendly face and huggable size make it ideal for snuggling, bedtime stories, and imaginative play. Whether it is a gift for a loved one or a new addition to your own collection, this bear is sure to bring smiles and comfort for years to come. Embrace the warmth and charm of this delightful bear and create lasting memories with a new, cuddly friend.',1.70,300,25,13,13,'Beer2.jpg','Beer.jpg','Beer3.jpg',NULL,'€',0,NULL,NULL,'BE-900003'),(23,'Ergonomic Office Chair','With precise adjustments for seat height, backrest inclination and armrests, this chair offers the possibility of finding the ideal position for your posture, promoting correct spinal alignment and reducing muscle fatigue even after long periods of use.\nIn addition to its ergonomically optimised design, this chair is built with high-quality materials, guaranteeing durability and resistance to daily wear and tear. Its modern and elegant style complements any work environment, adding a touch of sophistication to your space.',250.00,200,6,16,15,'ErgonomicOfficeChair1.jpg','Chair.jpg','Chair2.jpg',NULL,'€',0,NULL,NULL,'OF-110001'),(24,'Conference Room Table','Elevate your workspace with our elegant Conference Room Table, designed to facilitate productive and professional meetings. Crafted with precision and high-quality materials, this table combines durability with sophisticated style. Its spacious surface provides ample room for documents, laptops, and other essentials, ensuring a comfortable and organized meeting environment. The sleek design and modern finish make it a perfect fit for any office decor, while its sturdy construction ensures long-lasting performance. Whether for brainstorming sessions, client presentations, or team meetings, our Conference Room Table is the ideal centerpiece for fostering collaboration and success in your office.',1750.00,20,1,16,15,'ConferenceRoomTable1.jpg','Table.jpg','Table2.jpg',NULL,'€',0,NULL,NULL,'OF-110002'),(25,'Soybean Seeds 10kg','Unlock the potential of your farm or garden with our Premium Soybean Seeds. Carefully selected for their high germination rate and robust growth, these seeds are perfect for producing a bountiful soybean crop.\nKnown for their versatility and nutritional value, soybeans are an excellent choice for sustainable farming and home gardening. Our soybean seeds are easy to plant and cultivate, offering excellent resistance to pests and diseases. Whether you are looking to enhance your crop yield or simply enjoy the benefits of home-grown soybeans, our Premium Soybean Seeds provide the quality and reliability you need for a successful harvest.',40.00,200,20,17,16,'Soybean.jpg','Soybean1.jpg','Soybean2.jpg',NULL,'€',0,NULL,NULL,'SE-210001'),(26,'Wheat Seeds 10kg','Ensure a successful and abundant crop with our Premium Wheat Seeds. Specially selected for their high germination rates and resilience, these seeds are ideal for both commercial farming and home gardening. Wheat is a staple grain known for its versatility and nutritional value, making it a valuable addition to any agricultural endeavor. Our wheat seeds are easy to plant and cultivate, offering robust growth and excellent resistance to various environmental conditions. Whether you are aiming to increase your crop yield or enjoy the benefits of home-grown wheat, our Premium Wheat Seeds provide the quality and reliability needed for a fruitful harvest.',40.00,200,20,17,16,'wheat.jpg','Wheat1.jpg','Wheat2.jpg',NULL,'€',0,NULL,NULL,'SE-210002'),(27,'Organic Carrots','Discover the crisp, sweet taste of our Organic Carrots, grown with care and commitment to sustainable farming practices. Free from synthetic pesticides and chemicals, these carrots are packed with natural goodness and essential nutrients. Perfect for snacking, cooking, or adding a crunchy touch to your salads, our organic carrots offer a delightful blend of flavor and health benefits. Each carrot is carefully harvested to ensure maximum freshness and quality. Choose our Organic Carrots for a delicious, wholesome addition to your meals, and experience the difference that truly fresh, organic produce can make.',3.00,70,4,18,17,'OrganicCarrots1.jpg','Carrots2.jpg','Carrots3.jpg',NULL,'€ / kg',0,NULL,NULL,'FO-310001'),(28,'Baby Spinach','Indulge in the fresh, vibrant taste of our Baby Spinach, the perfect addition to a healthy and delicious diet. These tender, young leaves are harvested at their peak for optimal flavor and nutrient content. Rich in vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants, our baby spinach is an excellent choice for salads, smoothies, and a variety of cooked dishes. Its delicate texture and mild, slightly sweet flavor make it versatile and easy to incorporate into any meal. Enjoy the wholesome benefits and delightful taste of our Baby Spinach, and elevate your culinary creations with this nutrient-packed green.',4.00,70,4,18,17,'BabySpinach1.jpg','Spinach2.jpg','Spinach1.jpg',NULL,'€ / kg',0,NULL,NULL,'FO-310002'),(29,'Cattle Feed Pellets 25kg','Maximize the health and productivity of your cattle with our premium Cattle Feed Pellets. Formulated with a balanced blend of essential nutrients, vitamins, and minerals, these pellets provide complete and balanced nutrition to support the growth and well-being of your herd. Our feed pellets are carefully crafted to meet the specific dietary requirements of cattle at different stages of life, ensuring optimal health and performance. Convenient and easy to feed, these pellets are ideal for supplementing grazing or as a primary source of nutrition in a feedlot setting. Trust in our Cattle Feed Pellets to promote strong bones, healthy digestion, and robust immune function in your cattle, and help them thrive in any environment.',35.00,100,20,19,19,'CattleFeedPellets.jpg','CattleFeed2.jpg','CattleFeed1.jpg',NULL,'€',0,NULL,NULL,'CA-410001'),(30,'Layer Poultry Feed 25kg','Elevate the health and egg production of your laying hens with our premium Layer Poultry Feed. Expertly formulated with a balanced blend of essential nutrients, vitamins, and minerals, our feed is designed to meet the unique dietary needs of laying hens. Each ingredient is carefully selected to promote strong eggshells, vibrant plumage, and overall bird health. Our Layer Poultry Feed encourages consistent egg production and supports the well-being of your flock. Whether you are a backyard enthusiast or a commercial poultry farmer, trust in our high-quality feed to provide the nutrition your layers need to thrive and produce nutritious eggs for your family or customers.',35.00,100,20,19,19,'LayerPoultryFeed.jpg','LayerPoultry1.jpg','LayerPoultry2.jpg',NULL,'€',0,NULL,NULL,'CA-410002'),(31,'Pet First Aid Kit','Ensure the safety and well-being of your furry friend with our Pet First Aid Kit. Designed for pet owners and caregivers, this comprehensive kit contains essential supplies to handle common pet emergencies and injuries. From cuts and scrapes to insect bites and sprains, our kit includes bandages, gauze pads, antiseptic wipes, and other medical essentials to provide immediate care to your pet. Additionally, it features items such as tweezers, scissors, and a thermometer to assist in assessing and treating injuries. Compact and portable, our Pet First Aid Kit is perfect for home use, travel, hikes, or any outdoor adventure with your pet. Be prepared for the unexpected and give your pet the care they deserve with our Pet First Aid Kit.',35.00,70,5,21,20,'PetFirstAidKit2.jpg','Aid.jpg','Aid1.jpg',NULL,'€',0,NULL,NULL,'PE-510001'),(32,'Dental Hygiene Set for Pets','Promote good oral health for your furry companion with our Dental Hygiene Set for Pets. Designed to make pet dental care easy and effective, this set includes everything you need to maintain your pets oral hygiene. The set features a specially designed toothbrush and toothpaste formulated for pets, allowing you to gently brush away plaque and tartar buildup to prevent dental issues such as gum disease and bad breath. Additionally, the set includes dental wipes for quick and convenient cleaning between brushings. Regular dental care is essential for your pets overall health and well-being, and our Dental Hygiene Set makes it simple to keep your pets teeth clean and their smile bright.',40.00,70,5,21,21,'DentalHygieneSetforPets1.jpg','Dental1.jpg','Dental2.jpg',NULL,'€',0,NULL,NULL,'PR-610001'),(33,'Adjustable Resistance Bands Set','Take your workouts to the next level with our Adjustable Resistance Bands Set. Designed for versatility and convenience, this set includes a variety of resistance bands with adjustable resistance levels, allowing you to customize your workout intensity to suit your fitness level and goals. Whether you are toning muscles, building strength, or improving flexibility, these bands provide a challenging and effective workout experience. Compact and portable, they are perfect for use at home, in the gym, or while traveling, ensuring you never miss a workout session. With their durable construction and comfortable handles, our Adjustable Resistance Bands Set is your go-to fitness companion for achieving your fitness goals anytime, anywhere.',35.00,300,40,22,23,'AdjustableResistanceBandsSet1.jpg','Bands1.jpg','Bands2.jpg',NULL,'€',0,NULL,NULL,'TR-710001'),(34,'Agility Ladder','Elevate your athletic performance with our Agility Ladder, designed to help you improve agility, speed, and coordination. This versatile training tool features a series of flat rungs spaced at regular intervals, allowing you to perform a variety of footwork drills and agility exercises. Whether you are an athlete looking to enhance your performance or a fitness enthusiast seeking to level up your workouts, our Agility Ladder is suitable for all skill levels and fitness goals. Compact and portable, it can be used indoors or outdoors, making it perfect for home gyms, sports teams, or fitness classes. With consistent use, our Agility Ladder will help you develop quickness, agility, and explosiveness, enabling you to excel in any sport or fitness activity.',25.00,100,5,22,23,'AgilityLadder1.jpg','Ladder1.jpg','Ladder2.jpg',NULL,'€',0,NULL,NULL,'TR-710002'),(35,'Portable Soccer Goal','Take your love for soccer anywhere you go with our Portable Soccer Goal. Whether you are practicing drills in the backyard, playing pickup games at the park, or training with your team on the go, this goal is the perfect companion for soccer enthusiasts of all ages and skill levels. Designed for convenience and durability, our portable goal is lightweight yet sturdy, making it easy to transport and set up in minutes. The weather-resistant material ensures long-lasting performance, rain or shine. With its collapsible design, it is compact enough to fit in your car trunk or storage bag, so you can bring the excitement of soccer wherever you roam. Get ready to score goals and make memories with our Portable Soccer Goal!',150.00,70,5,22,23,'PortableSoccerGoal1.jpg','Goal1.jpg','Goal2.jpg',NULL,'€',0,NULL,NULL,'TR-710003'),(36,'Commercial Treadmill','Elevate your fitness routine with our Commercial Treadmill, designed for professional-grade performance in commercial gym settings. Featuring a robust construction and powerful motor, this treadmill is built to withstand the demands of high-intensity workouts and heavy usage. With a spacious running surface and advanced cushioning system, it provides a comfortable and responsive running experience, reducing impact on your joints while maximizing performance. Equipped with a variety of pre-programmed workouts and customizable settings, our Commercial Treadmill offers versatility to accommodate users of all fitness levels and goals. Its user-friendly interface and intuitive controls make it easy to navigate through workout options and track progress. Whether you are training for a marathon or just getting started on your fitness journey, our Commercial Treadmill is the ultimate tool for achieving your goals with precision and efficiency.',2000.00,70,10,24,23,'CommercialTreadmill1.png','Treadmill1.png','Treadmill2.png',NULL,'€',0,NULL,NULL,'TR-710004'),(37,'Adjustable Weith Bench','Transform your home gym with our Adjustable Weight Bench, the perfect addition to your workout routine. Designed for versatility and comfort, this weight bench allows you to perform a wide range of exercises, from bench presses and dumbbell workouts to leg lifts and crunches. With multiple incline and decline positions, as well as adjustable seat and backrest settings, you can customize your workout to target different muscle groups with precision. The durable steel frame and high-density foam padding ensure stability and comfort during intense workouts, while the compact design makes it easy to store when not in use. Whether you are a beginner or a seasoned athlete, our Adjustable Weight Bench provides the support and versatility you need to achieve your fitness goals.',500.00,70,10,24,23,'AdjustableWeithBench1.jpg','Bench2.jpg','Bench.png',NULL,'€',0,NULL,NULL,'TR-710008'),(38,'Hex Dumbbell Set','Take your strength training to the next level with our Hex Dumbbell Set, a versatile and essential addition to any home gym or fitness center. Crafted from premium cast iron with a durable rubber coating, these hexagonal dumbbells are designed to withstand heavy use and provide a secure grip during workouts. The hexagonal shape prevents rolling, ensuring safety and convenience during storage and use. With a wide range of weight options available, from light to heavy, our dumbbell set is suitable for users of all fitness levels and goals. Whether you are performing curls, presses, lunges, or squats, our Hex Dumbbell Set offers the versatility and durability you need to build strength, tone muscles, and achieve your fitness objectives.',1800.00,70,10,24,23,'HexDumbbellSet2.jpg','Hex1.jpg','Hex2.jpg',NULL,'€',0,NULL,NULL,'TR-710009'),(39,'Styrofoam Corner Protectors 20un','Keep your fragile items safe during shipping and storage with our Styrofoam Corner Protectors. Designed to cushion and support, these corner protectors are crafted from high-quality styrofoam, offering reliable protection against bumps, impacts, and rough handling. The lightweight and durable construction make them ideal for use with a variety of items, including furniture, electronics, artwork, and more. Their versatile design fits snugly around corners, providing added stability and reinforcement to vulnerable areas. Easy to install and remove, our Styrofoam Corner Protectors ensure peace of mind knowing your valuables are well-protected against damage. Whether you are moving house or shipping packages, trust in our corner protectors to safeguard your belongings every step of the way.',15.00,150,20,26,25,'StyrofoamCornerProtectors1.jpg','Corner.jpg','Corner2.jpg',NULL,'€',0,NULL,NULL,'ST-810001'),(40,'Styrofoam Packing Peanuts 10kg','Ensure the safe arrival of your items with our Styrofoam Packing Peanuts. These lightweight and versatile packing materials provide reliable cushioning and protection during shipping and transportation. Made from high-quality styrofoam, they are designed to absorb shocks and vibrations, preventing damage to fragile or delicate items. Their interlocking shape allows them to fill voids and gaps in packages, creating a snug and secure fit for your products. Additionally, Styrofoam Packing Peanuts are static-free and resistant to moisture, ensuring that your items arrive in pristine condition. Whether you are shipping electronics, glassware, or other delicate items, trust in our packing peanuts to keep your shipments safe and secure.',19.99,100,10,26,25,'StyrofoamPackingPeanuts3.jpg','Peanuts.jpg','Peanuts1.jpg',NULL,'€',0,NULL,NULL,'ST-810002'),(41,'Corrugated Shipping Box','Ensure the safe and secure delivery of your goods with our Corrugated Shipping Boxes. Crafted from high-quality corrugated cardboard, these boxes offer superior strength and durability to withstand the rigors of transportation. The corrugated construction provides added cushioning and protection against impacts, ensuring that your items arrive at their destination in pristine condition. With a variety of sizes available, our shipping boxes are versatile enough to accommodate a wide range of products, from small items to large and bulky items. Their sturdy design and secure closure options make them ideal for shipping, storage, and moving. Trust in our Corrugated Shipping Boxes to provide reliable protection for all your shipping needs.',2.99,200,20,29,26,'CorrugatedShippingBox1.jpg','CorrugatedShippingBox1.jpg','CorrugatedShippingBox1.jpg',NULL,'€',0,NULL,NULL,'PA-910001'),(43,'Poly Mailers','Streamline your shipping process with our Poly Mailers, the perfect choice for mailing documents, clothing, and other lightweight items. Crafted from high-quality polyethylene material, these mailers offer durability and tear resistance to protect your shipments during transit. The self-sealing adhesive strip ensures a secure closure, eliminating the need for additional tape or sealing equipment. With their lightweight construction, Poly Mailers help reduce shipping costs while providing reliable protection against moisture, dirt, and tampering. Available in various sizes and styles, they are suitable for a wide range of applications, from e-commerce shipping to personal mailings. Simplify your shipping operations and ensure your packages arrive safely with our Poly Mailers.',0.20,200,20,29,27,'PolyMailers1.jpg','PolyMailers1.jpg','PolyMailers1.jpg',NULL,'€',0,NULL,NULL,'CU-111001'),(44,'Bespoke Luxury Packaging','Make a lasting impression with our Bespoke Packaging solutions, tailored to meet your unique brand and product needs. From concept to creation, we work closely with you to design packaging that reflects your brand identity and enhances the unboxing experience for your customers. Our team of experts utilizes premium materials, innovative designs, and cutting-edge printing techniques to create packaging that stands out on the shelf and leaves a memorable impression. Whether you are launching a new product, rebranding your business, or seeking to differentiate yourself in the market, our Bespoke Packaging solutions offer the perfect combination of style, functionality, and customization. Elevate your brand and leave a lasting impression with packaging that speaks volumes about your commitment to quality and excellence.',79.99,70,10,29,27,'LuxuryBrandPackaging3.png','Lux1.png','Lux2.png',NULL,'€',0,NULL,NULL,'CU-111002'),(45,'Biodegradable Tape','Make a lasting impression with our Bespoke Packaging solutions, tailored to meet your unique brand and product needs. From concept to creation, we work closely with you to design packaging that reflects your brand identity and enhances the unboxing experience for your customers. Our team of experts utilizes premium materials, innovative designs, and cutting-edge printing techniques to create packaging that stands out on the shelf and leaves a memorable impression. Whether you are launching a new product, rebranding your business, or seeking to differentiate yourself in the market, our Bespoke Packaging solutions offer the perfect combination of style, functionality, and customization. Elevate your brand and leave a lasting impression with packaging that speaks volumes about your commitment to quality and excellence.',4.99,170,15,30,27,'BiodegradableTape1.jpg','Tape1.jpg','Tape2.jpg',NULL,'€',0,NULL,NULL,'CU-111003'),(46,'Bubble Mailers','Ensure the safety of your items during transit with our Bubble Mailers. These durable and lightweight mailers are designed to provide maximum protection for your shipments. Featuring a bubble-lined interior, they offer an extra layer of cushioning to safeguard your products from bumps, drops, and other shipping hazards. The self-sealing adhesive strip makes it easy to secure your packages, while the tear-resistant outer layer ensures that your items stay intact throughout their journey. Available in various sizes, our Bubble Mailers are perfect for shipping delicate items such as electronics, cosmetics, jewelry, and more. Trust in our Bubble Mailers to deliver your products securely and with peace of mind.',1.99,170,25,30,27,'BubbleMailers1.jpg','Bubble.jpg','Bubble2.jpg',NULL,'€',0,NULL,NULL,'CU-111004'),(47,'Eco-Pack Box','Make a positive impact on the environment while protecting your shipments with our Eco-Pack Box. Crafted from recycled and biodegradable materials, this eco-friendly packaging solution offers a sustainable alternative to traditional shipping boxes. Designed for durability and reliability, our Eco-Pack Box provides sturdy protection for your products during transit, ensuring they arrive safely at their destination. The minimalist design and earthy tones reflect our commitment to sustainability, making it the perfect choice for eco-conscious businesses and individuals. With its versatile design and eco-friendly materials, our Eco-Pack Box allows you to package your products with confidence, knowing that you are making a responsible choice for the planet. Join us in reducing waste and preserving the environment with our Eco-Pack Box.',7.99,170,25,30,27,'Eco-PackProSeries1.png','EcoPack2.png','EcoPack2.png',NULL,'€',0,NULL,NULL,'CU-111005'),(48,'Teste Produto','Teste',25.00,100,10,36,6,'1719571047093.jpg','1719571047096.jpg','1719571047097.jpg','1719571047099.jpg','€',1,15.99,36,'ME-487703');
