INSERT INTO `sub_departments` VALUES (1,'Textiles',1,'Discover the essence of elegance in our Fabrics category. From linen to cotton and silk, we offer a premium selection for all your needs. Find the quality and variety your brand deserves. Explore now!'),(2,'Sustainable Fibers',1,'Discover ecological innovation in our Sustainable Fibres category. We offer a selection of eco-friendly fibres that combine sustainability with superior performance. Find materials that meet your business needs and contribute to a greener future. Explore now!'),(3,'Clothing & Acessories',1,'Discover excellence in our Clothing and Accessories category. We offer elegant corporate uniforms and functional accessories that combine professionalism with style. Find personalised solutions that meet the specific needs of your business and reinforce your brand identity. Explore now!'),(4,'Clothing Production Services',1,'Explore excellence in our Clothing Production Services category. We offer complete solutions, from design to manufacturing, guaranteeing high quality and precision at every stage. Find trusted partners to turn your ideas into successful products. Explore now!'),(5,'Makeup & Skincare',2,'Discover the basis of beauty in our Makeup and Skincare category. We offer high-quality raw materials that are essential for making make-up and skincare products. Find innovative and sustainable ingredients that meet the needs of your business and guarantee the excellence of your final products. Explore now!'),(6,'Men Grooming',2,'Discover sophistication in our Mens Grooming category. We offer a premium selection of mens grooming products and accessories, from shaving essentials to advanced hair and skin treatments. Find everything your business needs to provide a superior grooming experience. Explore now!'),(7,'Eletronic Components',3,'Explore innovation in our Electronic Components category. We offer a wide selection of high-quality electronic components, essential for manufacturing modern devices. Find solutions that meet the needs of your business, guaranteeing exceptional performance and reliability. Explore now!'),(8,'Cables',3,'Discover superior connectivity in our Cables category. We offer a range of high-quality network cables, essential for ensuring fast and reliable data transmission. Find solutions that meet your business needs and support the demands of modern infrastructure. Explore now!'),(9,'Printing',3,'Explore innovation in our Printing category. We offer a wide range of high-quality 3D printing materials and equipment, ideal for prototyping and customised production. Find advanced solutions that meet your business needs and boost creativity and precision. Explore now!'),(10,'Fruits & Vegetables',4,'Discover freshness in our Fruits and Vegetables category. We offer a variety of fresh, high-quality products, grown with care and harvested at the height of the season. Find a diverse selection that meets the needs of your business, guaranteeing exceptional flavour and quality. Explore now!'),(11,'Cheese & Dairy',4,'Explore indulgence in our Cheese and Dairy category. We offer a premium selection of cheeses and dairy products, carefully selected to deliver exceptional flavour and quality. Find a variety of options, from artisan cheeses to fresh dairy products, to meet the needs of your business and satisfy the most demanding palates. Explore now!'),(12,'Meet & Seafood',4,'Discover freshness in our Meat and Seafood category. We offer a premium selection of fresh meat and seafood from reliable and sustainable sources. Find a variety of succulent cuts of meat and fresh seafood, guaranteeing exceptional quality and flavour for your dishes. Explore now!'),(13,'Beverages',4,'Explore flavour in our Bevereges category. We offer a premium selection of refreshing and invigorating drinks, carefully selected to provide an exceptional taste experience. Find a variety of options, from fine wines and quality spirits to natural juices and flavoured waters, to meet the needs of your business and delight the most discerning palates. Explore now!'),(14,'Interior Decoration Services',5,'Discover the art of transforming spaces in our Interior Design Services category. We offer personalised, high-quality solutions to create inspiring and functional environments. From interior design to the installation of furniture and accessories, our specialised team is here to turn your vision into reality. Explore now and bring your space to life!'),(15,'Office Furniture',5,'Explore comfort and functionality in our Office Furniture category. We offer a range of high-quality furniture designed to create efficient and inspiring workspaces. Find ergonomic and stylish solutions that meet the needs of your business, providing comfort and productivity for your team. Explore now and transform your office into a successful environment!'),(16,'Seeds',6,'Discover the potential in our Seeds category. We offer a wide range of high-quality seeds, carefully selected to ensure the success of your growing project. Find options that meet the needs of your business, whether for gardening, agriculture or landscaping. With reliable seeds and guaranteed provenance, we are here to help you cultivate a promising future. Explore now and plant the seeds of success!'),(17,'Food Production',6,'Explore excellence in our Food Production category. We offer comprehensive and customised solutions to meet the demands of the food sector, from processing to packaging and distribution. With advanced technology and stringent quality standards, we guarantee the production of safe, tasty and sustainable food. Explore now and find out how we can raise the quality and efficiency of your food production chain!'),(18,'Agro-Techonology & Services',6,'Discover innovation in agriculture in our Agro-technology and Services category. We offer advanced technological solutions and specialised services to boost efficiency and sustainability in the agricultural sector. From monitoring and automation systems to specialised crop management consultancy, we are here to help your business thrive in the field. Explore now and take your agricultural production to the next level!'),(19,'Cattle Feed',7,'Discover quality nutrition in our Cattle Feed category. We offer a variety of high quality feed and feed supplements, developed to meet the specific nutritional needs of your herd. With selected ingredients and specialised formulas, we guarantee a healthy and balanced diet for your animals, promoting their growth and well-being. Explore now and offer your animals the best in nutrition!'),(20,'Pet Medication',7,'Discover essential care in our Pet Medicines category. We offer a wide range of high-quality medicines and treatments designed to ensure the health and well-being of your pets. From flea and tick control products to medicines for specific health conditions, our comprehensive selection meets the needs of all species and sizes. Explore now and provide the best care for your furry companions!'),(21,'Products & Equipment',7,'Explore the world of pet care in our Pet Products and Equipment category. We offer a variety of high-quality products, from food and snacks to essential accessories and equipment to ensure the comfort and well-being of your furry companions. With a carefully selected selection geared to every need, we are here to help you provide a happy and healthy life for your pets. Explore now and find everything your pet needs to live their best life!'),(22,'Pet Grooming',7,'Discover the luxury of grooming in our Pet Grooming category. We offer a range of premium products and services to keep your pets looking pristine and healthy. From relaxing baths to professional haircuts and spa treatments, our specialised team is here to provide a first-class grooming experience for your furry friends. Explore now and give your pet the treatment it deserves!'),(23,'Training Equipment',8,'Explore excellence in training in our Training Equipment category. We offer a variety of high-quality equipment designed to aid training and skill development. From fitness equipment to behavioural training accessories, our comprehensive selection meets the needs of coaches, athletes and fitness enthusiasts. Explore now and take your workouts to the next level!'),(24,'Managment Software Services',8,'Discover management efficiency with our Management Software Services. We offer specialised digital solutions designed to optimise and simplify business processes. From project management systems to data analysis platforms, our range of services covers all areas of your operation. With intuitive and customisable tools, we are here to help your company reach new heights of productivity and success. Explore now and transform your management with cutting-edge technology!'),(25,'Styrofoam',9,'Discover the versatility of Styrofoam in our dedicated category. We offer a wide range of Styrofoam products, from boards and blocks to special shapes and customised products. With its lightness and strength, Styrofoam is ideal for a variety of applications, including packaging, thermal insulation and construction. Explore now and discover how Styrofoam can meet your design needs efficiently and practically.'),(26,'Packaging Materials',9,'Explore excellence in packaging with our Packaging Materials category. We offer a comprehensive range of high-quality packaging materials designed to meet the diverse needs of your business. From boxes and envelopes to packaging films and filling materials, our selection covers everything you need to protect, transport and present your products safely and stylishly. Explore now and find the perfect solutions for packaging your products!'),(27,'Custom Packaging',9,'Discover personalisation in packaging with our Custom Packaging category. We offer exclusive, tailor-made solutions to make your brand stand out and impress your customers. From design to production, our specialised team is committed to creating unique packaging that conveys your message and value in a memorable way. With a variety of material options, finishes and sizes, we are here to turn your ideas into reality. Explore now and raise the standard of your packaging!');
